[size=5][b]• Requirements[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Conan Exiles Enhanced 3.0.1[/b] (build CL-379176).[/*]
[*][url=https://www.7-zip.org/]7-Zip[/url] or [url=https://www.win-rar.com/]WinRAR[/url] to unpack the multi-part archive.[/*]
[*]Free disk space: 12.7 GB for the archive parts and as much again for the unpacked pack.[/*]
[*]Nothing else: every mod and the UE4SS loader are inside the archive, no Steam Workshop subscriptions are needed.[/*]
[*]The pack switches the game to Russian and to fullscreen 3840 × 2160.[/*]
[/list]
[size=5][b]• Installation instructions[/b][/size]

[color=#d4d4d8][b][size=4]Installation Instructions:[/size][/b][/color]
[color=#D4D4D8]1. Ensure that the game [b][i]Conan Exiles Enhanced 3.0.1[/i][/b] (build CL-379176) is installed.
2. Download all parts of the archive—Krinik_Mod_Pack_0_9_0.zip.001, .002, and any subsequent parts—into a single folder.
3. Open the first part, Krinik_Mod_Pack_0_9_0.zip.001, using 7-Zip or WinRAR, and extract the mod pack into the game’s root directory (where [b][i]ConanSandbox.exe[/i][/b] is located).
4. Run [b][i]KrinikConanLauncher.exe[/i][/b] from the mod pack folder and click "Install Mod Pack" ("Установить сборку").
5. Click "Play" ("Играть").
6. The mod pack defaults to full-screen mode at 3840 × 2160 resolution. If your screen resolution is lower than 4K, please adjust it in the game settings.

[i]Uninstallation: Close the game, run [b]KrinikConanLauncher.exe[/b], click [Remove Mod Pack] ([Удалить сборку]), and confirm your choice.[/i][/color]

